OL,3,GNEWSAHenry Nowak killer has sentence
OL,4,Aincreased to 25 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe murderer of Henry Nowak has had his
OL,7,Fminimum prison term increased to 25
OL,8,Fyears.
OL,10,FVickrum Digwa stabbed the 18-year-old
OL,11,Fstudent with a large dagger in Belmont
OL,12,FRoad, Southampton, on 3 December 2025.
OL,14,FHis 21-year sentence was reviewed at
OL,15,Fthe Court of Appeal, following a
OL,16,Freferral from the Attorney General,
OL,17,Fwhere judges agreed it was "unduly
OL,18,Flenient" and refused him permission to
OL,19,Fappeal against it.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
